codeExample.python:
import requests

response = requests.post(
    "https://api.aiflowhub.ai/v1/chat/completions",
    headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer AIFLOWHUB_API_KEY"},
    json={"model": "deepseek-reasoner", "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello"}]}
)

codeExample.nodejs:
const response = await fetch("https://api.aiflowhub.ai/v1/chat/completions", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: { "Authorization": "Bearer " + process.env.AIFLOWHUB_API_KEY },
  body: JSON.stringify({ model: "deepseek-reasoner", messages: [{ role: "user", content: "Hello" }] })
});

